# Normalize every text file to LF inside the repository.
#
# Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true, which checks files out
# with CRLF. .prettierrc.json sets endOfLine: "lf", so without this file
# `pnpm format:check` fails on every file — on a contributor's machine and
# in CI alike. `* text=auto eol=lf` stores LF and checks out LF everywhere,
# which makes the check platform-independent.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary formats must never be line-ending converted.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.pdf  binary
